        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 24.82,
          "en": "And the device should guess,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.82,
          "end": 28.123,
          "en": "the phone should guess our chosen number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.02,
          "end": 31.04,
          "en": "Now to generate this guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.04,
          "end": 34.04,
          "en": "we need to calculate a random number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.04,
          "end": 38.39,
          "en": "And for this attached, you find this utility function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.39,
          "end": 40.79,
          "en": "which generates a random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.79,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "between a min and a max number defined as imports here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 48.35,
          "en": "And we can also pass in an exclude number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.35,
          "end": 50.6,
          "en": "which allows us to exclude a certain number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.6,
          "end": 51.92,
          "en": "from being generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.92,
          "end": 54.56,
          "en": "which will be important for making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.56,
          "end": 56.66,
          "en": "that we can't immediately guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.66,
          "end": 59.33,
          "en": "the number chosen by the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.33,
          "end": 63.19,
          "en": "because here I wanna make sure that the phone is not able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.19,
          "end": 66.26,
          "en": "to guess the correct number right at the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.26,
          "end": 69.32,
          "en": "And therefore I add this exclude parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.32,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "which allows me to exclude that single number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.09,
          "en": "so that the phone can't win automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.09,
          "end": 76.69,
          "en": "in the first round.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.69,
          "end": 78.55,
          "en": "It's a little extra difficulty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.55,
          "end": 80.92,
          "en": "that's added here for the phone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.92,
          "end": 83.2,
          "en": "hence these three parameter values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.2,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "And then inside of this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 89.96000000000001,
          "en": "I generate a random number with this calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.96000000000001,
          "end": 93.22999999999999,
          "en": "where I use math random which creates a random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.22999999999999,
          "end": 97.06,
          "en": "between zero and one with one excluded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.06,
          "end": 99.25999999999999,
          "en": "And I then multiply this with the difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.25999999999999,
          "end": 103.1,
          "en": "between max and min to translate this random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.1,
          "end": 106.14,
          "en": "between zero and one, to a random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.14,
          "end": 107.95,
          "en": "between our max and min",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "and I use math.floor to then round this down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 113.92,
          "en": "Since this would give us a decimal number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.92,
          "end": 116.71000000000001,
          "en": "with decimal places, and we don't want that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.71000000000001,
          "end": 120.87,
          "en": "We want integer and we round down with math floor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.87,
          "end": 122.75,
          "en": "And since we're rounding down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.75,
          "end": 125.69,
          "en": "we actually add our minimum boundary again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.69,
          "end": 128.65,
          "en": "so that the lowest number we can get is not zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.65,
          "end": 130.63,
          "en": "which would be the lowest number otherwise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.63,
          "end": 135.05,
          "en": "because math.random can produce zero as a result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.05,
          "end": 137.84,
          "en": "but that instead our lowest possible boundary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.84,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "is the minimum defined here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 141.55,
          "en": "That's what we do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.55,
          "end": 144.51,
          "en": "And then here, I just check if that random number happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.51,
          "end": 146.76,
          "en": "to be that number that we excluded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.76,
          "end": 149.24,
          "en": "in which case we call generateRandomBetween",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.24,
          "end": 153.6,
          "en": "again recursively to simply calculate a new random number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 156.65,
          "en": "And we keep on doing this until we derived a random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.65,
          "end": 160.02,
          "en": "that's not equal to the excluded number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.02,
          "end": 162.62,
          "en": "And if we did not hit the excluded number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.62,
          "end": 164.543,
          "en": "we just returned a random number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.38,
          "end": 167.37,
          "en": "So this generates random numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.37,
          "end": 169.69,
          "en": "and now wanna generate a random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.69,
          "end": 172.09,
          "en": "when that game screen is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.09,
          "end": 174.74,
          "en": "The first guest made by the device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.74,
